{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:09:36.635Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/multicast-fdb **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/multicast-fdb \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**Type：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/one2one-vlan-switching **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/one2one-vlan-switching \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/policer-qos-map **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/policer-qos-map \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**Type：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port **Syscap:** rbswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port \n**Syscap：** rbswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port-isolation **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port-isolation \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port-isolation **Syscap:** rbswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port-isolation \n**Syscap：** rbswitch\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port-leakage **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port-leakage \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port/reset-counters **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port/reset-counters \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/port/reset-counters **Syscap:** rbswitch **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/switch/port/reset-counters \n**Syscap：** rbswitch\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/protocol-based-vlan **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/protocol-based-vlan \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**Type：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map **Syscap:** rbswitch and crs_prestera **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map \n**Syscap：** rbswitch 和 crs_prestera\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map/ip **Syscap:** rbswitch and crs_prestera **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map/ip \n**Syscap：** rbswitch 和 crs_prestera\n**Type：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map/vlan **Syscap:** rbswitch and crs_prestera **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/qos/map/vlan \n**Syscap：** rbswitch 和 crs_prestera\n**Type：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000- Devices based on **Marvell Prestera **98DX224S, 98DX226S****, or ****98DX3236**** switch chip models support only one map - default. - Devices based on **Marvell Prestera 98DX8xxx**, **98DX4xxx** switch chips, or **98DX325x** model devices support up to 12 maps(the default + 11 user-defined).":"- 基于 **Marvell Prestera **98DX224S, 98DX226S**** 或 ****98DX3236**** 交换机芯片型号的设备仅支持一个映射 - default。\n- 基于 **Marvell Prestera 98DX8xxx**、**98DX4xxx** 交换机芯片的设备，或 **98DX325x** 型号设备最多支持 12 个映射（默认映射 + 11 个用户定义映射）。","docs-7.25\u0000- Port-level isolation - MAC-level isolation - VLAN-level isolation - Protocol-level isolation - Flow-level isolation - Free combination of the above":"- 端口级隔离\n- MAC 级隔离\n- VLAN 级隔离\n- 协议级隔离\n- 流级隔离\n- 以上功能的自由组合","docs-7.25\u0000- When the entry is programmed with destination port access control, the entry":"- 当该条目配置了目标端口访问控制时，该条目","docs-7.25\u0000- When the entry is programmed with source port access control, the entry is.":"- 当表项编程为源端口访问控制时，该表项为。","docs-7.25\u00001:1 VLAN switching can be used to replace the regular L2 bridging for matched packets. When a packet hits a 1:1 VLAN switching table entry, the destination port information in the entry is assigned to the packet. The matched destination information in the UFDB and MFDB entries no longer applies to the packet.":"1:1 VLAN switching 可用于替代匹配数据包的常规 L2 网桥。当数据包命中 1:1 VLAN switching 表项时，表项中的目的端口信息会分配给该数据包。UFDB 和 MFDB 表项中匹配的目的信息不再适用于该数据包。","docs-7.25\u0000CRS125 switch-chip supports up to 1024 entries in the MFDB for multicast forwarding. For each multicast packet, destination MAC or destination IP lookup is performed in the MFDB. MFDB entries are not automatically learned and can only be configured.":"CRS125 交换芯片在 MFDB 中最多支持 1024 个用于组播转发的条目。对于每个组播数据包，会在 MFDB 中执行目的 MAC 或目的 IP 查找。MFDB 条目不会自动学习，只能手动配置。","docs-7.25\u0000Matches DSCP values to QoS profiles.":"将 DSCP 值匹配到 QoS 配置文件。","docs-7.25\u0000Matches VLAN priorities(802.1p PCP/DEI fields) to QoS profiles. By default, all values are matched to the default QoS profile.":"将 VLAN 优先级（802.1p PCP/DEI 字段）匹配到 QoS 配置文件。默认情况下，所有值都会匹配到默认 QoS 配置文件。","docs-7.25\u0000Port leakage allows bypassing egress VLAN filtering on the port. A leaky port is allowed to access other ports for various applications such as security, network control, and management. Note: When both isolation and leakage are applied to the same port, the port is isolated.":"端口泄漏允许绕过端口上的出站 VLAN 过滤。泄漏端口允许访问其他端口，用于安全、网络控制和管理等各类应用。注意：当同一端口同时应用隔离和泄漏时，该端口将被隔离。","docs-7.25\u0000Port-level isolation supports different control schemes on the source port and destination port. Each entry can be programmed with access control for either the source port or the destination port.":"端口级隔离支持在源端口和目的端口上使用不同的控制方案。每个表项都可以针对源端口或目的端口编程访问控制。","docs-7.25\u0000Priority-to-profile mapping table(-s) for trusted packets. All switch chips have one built-in map - **default**. In addition, some models allow the user to define custom mapping tables and assign different maps to various switch ports via the **qos-map** property:":"可信数据包的优先级到配置文件映射表。所有交换机芯片都有一个内置映射 - **default**。此外，某些型号允许用户定义自定义映射表，并通过 **qos-map** 属性将不同映射分配给各个交换机端口：","docs-7.25\u0000The CRS switches support flexible multi-level isolation features, which can be used for user access control, traffic engineering and advanced security and network management. The isolation features provide an organized fabric structure allowing the user to easily program and control the access by port, MAC address, VLAN, protocol, flow, and frame type. The following isolation and leakage features are supported:":"CRS 交换机支持灵活的多级隔离功能，可用于用户访问控制、流量工程以及高级安全和网络管理。隔离功能提供有组织的交换结构，使用户能够轻松编程并按端口、MAC 地址、VLAN、协议、流和帧类型控制访问。支持以下隔离和泄漏功能：","docs-7.25\u0000The Protocol Based VLAN table is used to assign VID and QoS attributes to related protocol packets per port.":"Protocol Based VLAN 表用于按端口为相关协议数据包分配 VID 和 QoS 属性。","docs-7.25\u0000applied to the ingress packets.":"应用于入站数据包。","docs-7.25\u0000is applied to the egress packets.":"应用于出站数据包。"}}
